---
title: Theme styling, taxonomy pages, and export
date: '2026-06-16'
tags:
  - added
  - changed
  - fixed
summary: Light/dark styling, tag and category pages, and an inventory ZIP export route, plus query-client and scan-client updates.
---

This source milestone added theme styling, taxonomy management, and export paths. It did not verify every dark surface or make an archive a complete evidence package.

- **Theme styling** on inventory, scan, and management routes, with a Light / Dark / System toggle.
- **Tag and category pages** for managing inventory taxonomy.
- **Data export** as CSV, JSON, or a ZIP containing item JSON and photo files still readable on disk. The ZIP route silently skips missing or unreadable photos, so the archive needs inspection.

The app also migrated to **svelte-query v6**, updated the scan model, moved validation to **Zod 4**, and repaired the scan API client.

The older inventory/location stills are withdrawn from this entry: their capture fixture and release provenance are unverified, they show placeholder images, and the dark inventory still has an unreadable add control. Fresh paired product captures and narrated films need a verified synthetic fixture and visual review.
